---
config:
  theme: default
description: >-
  one representative block diagram in the default theme (classic family, D215, D227): a circle, a
  diamond, a labelled composite with its band above the grid (D444), a stadium, a cylinder,
  a block arrow, a subroutine, a double circle with a class, a space, and three edges
  (solid, labelled, dotted)
---
block-beta
  columns 3
  start(("Start")) space check{"Valid?"}
  block:work["Work"]:3
    columns 3
    load["Load"] parse(["Parse"]) store[("Store")]
  end
  go<["Next"]>(right) report[["Report"]] done((("Done")))
  start --> check
  check -- "yes" --> work
  store -.-> report
  classDef hot fill:#f96,stroke:#333
  class done hot
